  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InspectableItem
  ItemName: Silas Marsh's Pocket Watch
  ItemDescription: Found by the stair hatch, its glass cracked. The hands stopped
    at <b>11:49</b>, when he fell. That's three minutes <i>before</i> the light went
    out at 11:52. Silas was already dead when the lamp went dark.
  ClueID: LH_WATCH
  NotebookNote: 'Stopped at 11:49 in the fall: before the light went out.'
  CanPickUp: 1
